  "title": "RESERVOIR ANNOUNCES JOINT VENTURE WITH LATIN MUSIC PUBLISHER TU PUBLISHING",
  "summary": "Reservoir Media, Inc. (NASDAQ: RSVR), an award-winning independent music company, today announced a joint venture with Latin music company TU Publishing. Under the agreement, Reservoir will serve as the publisher for all current and future writers signed to TU Publishing, as well as catalogs acquired by the company, providing marketing and administrative services and further […]",
